### Cambiar la ubicación de un job por locationId — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "locationId": 100,
  "locationAddress": "Av. Principal 123, Zona 10"
}

### Cambiar la ubicación de un job solo con dirección — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "locationAddress": "Nueva dirección de prueba"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeJobLocation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "locationId": 100,
  "locationAddress": "Av. Principal 123, Zona 10"
}

### Validación: sin jobId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": 100,
  "locationAddress": "Av. Principal 123, Zona 10"
}

### Validación: jobId menor o igual a 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/changeJobLocation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 0,
  "locationId": 100
}
